\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {22}{\ignorespaces Constructive singularity evaluator. Only the target-active quotient is analyzed. If it contains no singularity-aligned structure, normalized shell contact is impossible. Otherwise contact fixes an active branch signature and, when needed, a record-scale chart. The source-adapted dual carrier either charges target progress to physical production or creates a typed compactness successor. The next unresolved coordinate is split only on the retained target cell; every nonnull polarity cell re-enters the same compiler with larger resolved-prefix rank. A cofinal refinement is saturated diagonally, and a realized same-origin contact path is the sole singular terminal.}}{140}{figure.22}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:structural-regularity-compiler}{{22}{140}{Constructive singularity evaluator. Only the target-active quotient is analyzed. If it contains no singularity-aligned structure, normalized shell contact is impossible. Otherwise contact fixes an active branch signature and, when needed, a record-scale chart. The source-adapted dual carrier either charges target progress to physical production or creates a typed compactness successor. The next unresolved coordinate is split only on the retained target cell; every nonnull polarity cell re-enters the same compiler with larger resolved-prefix rank. A cofinal refinement is saturated diagonally, and a realized same-origin contact path is the sole singular terminal}{figure.22}{}}
\newlabel{fig:structural-regularity-compiler@cref}{{[figure][22][]22}{[1][139][]140}{}{}{}}
